    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so something weird happened about an hour ago. my vision in my left eye just went all blurry and fuzzy for like two mins and my right hand felt really clumsy like i couldn't really control my fingers well but then it just went away totally. i feel fine now but it was pretty scary. do i need to go to the hospital or is it probably nothing?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
