      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you but im just so stressed about the cost and the wait time. i'm 62, not that old, and i've lived a pretty healthy life. i dont have high blood pressure or anything like that. honestly, it felt more like a sudden eye twitch or a weird nerve thing. if i just take an aspirin and go to bed, and if it happens again i promise i'll go straight in, would that be okay? i just dont want to make a huge deal out of a two minute thing.",
